        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "STUNNING 3 BEDROOM DETACHED HOUSE \r\nThis charming detached residence enjoys a wonderful setting surrounded by mature greenery and benefiting from beautiful elevated views over the surrounding countryside and lake. The property combines traditional character with a bright, comfortable layout, making it an appealing home or retreat in a particularly scenic location. Outside, the property sits within generous mature gardens, offering excellent privacy and a lovely connection with the surrounding landscape. The setting is particularly impressive, with views extending across the lake and rolling hills beyond, creating a peaceful and picturesque backdrop. With its attractive countryside setting, generous accommodation and wonderful outlook, this property offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable home in a tranquil rural location.\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION: \r\nKitchen, Living Room/Dining area, Utility, Hallway, 3 Bedrooms (One Ensuite), Bathroom & Mezzanine."
